{"text": "Soapys first idea was to eat a fine dinner at an expensive restaurant and then say that he had no money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he would be handed quietly to a policeman, and a judge would send him to the Island. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He walked into a bright café on Broadway, where rich people enjoyed the finest food and wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His face was shaved and his coat was neat, but his old trousers and broken shoes told a different story. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Seeing those trousers and shoes, the head waiter quickly turned him around and pushed him out onto the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On Sixth Avenue, Soapy picked up a stone and threw it through a large shop window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People came running around the corner, with a policeman leading the crowd. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy stood still with his hands in his pockets and smiled at the policeman, waiting to be arrested. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The policeman asked who had broken the window, and Soapy said that he might have done it himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the policeman believed that men who break windows always run away, so he ran after another man instead.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "a", "p", "y", "s", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "i", "d", "e", "a", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "a", "t", " ", "a", " ", "f", "i", "n", "e", " ", "d", "i", "n", "n", "e", "r", " ", "a", "t", " ", "a", "n", " ", "e", "x", "p", "e", "n", "s", "i", "v", "e", " ", "r", "e", "s", "t", "a", "u", "r", "a", "n", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "a", "y", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "m", "o", "n", "e", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "b", "e", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "q", "u", "i", "